OL,3,GNEWSAMan murdered for home and life
OL,4,Asavings, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 60-year-old retiree who disappeared
OL,7,Fmore than two years ago was murdered by
OL,8,Fa man who then took his life savings
OL,9,Fand renovated his home, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FIbrahim Yosif, 44, is accused of
OL,13,Fkilling Gary Piatek, who disappeared on
OL,14,F18 April 2024 after going drinking in
OL,15,FLeicester, before moving his family
OL,16,Finto the missing man's home.
OL,18,FLeicester Crown Court heard on
OL,19,FWednesday that Yosif and his relatives
OL,20,Fdrained the man's bank accounts
OL,21,F"because they were confident that Gary
OL,22,FPiatek would never say a thing".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
