OL,3,GNEWSAMan murdered for home and life
OL,4,Asavings, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FYosif, of Broad Avenue, Leicester, and
OL,7,FOmed Firuzmand, 25, of Ashley Road,
OL,8,FBournemouth, Dorset, both deny murder
OL,9,Fand preventing a lawful burial.
